Package: lensguard-service
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: dbus, libc6 (>= 2.34), pipewire, systemd
Conflicts: lensguard
Replaces: lensguard
Maintainer: Younes Rabeh <younesrabeh@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/YounesRabeh/lensguard
Description: Camera monitor service for the Lens Guard GNOME extension
 Installs the Lens Guard user daemon, systemd user unit, and D-Bus activation
 service. The GNOME extension is installed separately from extensions.gnome.org.
